#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:39
msgid ""
"Open the :guilabel:`Settings` app, go to the :doc:`Companies <../../general/"
"companies>` section, and click :ref:`Update Info <general/companies/"
"company>`. Ensure the :guilabel:`NPWP` field contains the **Tax "
