#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:318
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:360
msgid ""
"Once an invoice is :ref:`created <accounting/invoice/creation>` "
"and :ref:`confirmed <accounting/invoice/confirmation>`, follow these steps:"
